  "description_short": "Hartenbos café serving quality coffee, hearty breakfasts, and homemade treats in a relaxed, family-friendly setting.",
  "description_long": "Around the Family Bean is a welcoming neighbourhood café in Hartenbos, where locals and holidaymakers gather for excellent coffee and generous home-style meals. The menu focuses on breakfast favourites and light lunches, with everything made fresh daily and served with genuine warmth.\n\nThe atmosphere is casual and unpretentious, making it perfect for families starting their beach day or friends catching up over a leisurely brunch. Their homemade baked goods are a highlight, and the coffee is consistently well-prepared. Located on Hartenbos's main road, it's a convenient spot whether you're staying in the area or passing through on your way to Mossel Bay's beaches.",
